%% OpenLess startup, permission, and recording flow
flowchart TD
    START([App launch / reopen]) --> HANDSHAKE{Backend handshake succeeds?}
    HANDSHAKE -- no --> ERROR[CoreStartupScreen\nshow failure]
    HANDSHAKE -- yes --> CAPS[Load platform capabilities]
    CAPS --> STATE[Read persisted onboarding state\nwith bounded startup deadline]
    STATE --> CREDS[Read credential status\nwith bounded startup deadline]
    CREDS --> GUIDE{Guide unfinished?}
    GUIDE -- yes --> ONBOARD[Show DesktopOnboarding]
    ONBOARD --> SAVE[Persist guide state before handoff]
    SAVE --> PERM
    GUIDE -- no --> PERM{Required permission missing?}
    PERM -- yes --> AUTH[Show permission step]
    AUTH --> TCC[Reset stale Accessibility TCC\nrequest system authorization prompt]
    TCC --> SETTINGS[If still not granted:\nopen System Settings]
    SETTINGS --> PERM
    PERM -- no --> READY[Gate ready]
    READY --> SILENT{start_minimized enabled?}
    SILENT -- yes --> TRAY[Keep main hidden; tray / hotkey can reopen]
    SILENT -- no --> MAIN[Show main WebView]
    TRAY --> MAIN

    MAIN --> RECORD
    HOTKEY[Recording hotkey] --> RECORD{Recording session starts?}
    RECORD -- no --> IDLE[Remain idle]
    RECORD -- yes --> CUE[Resident capsule receives\nrecording edge + audio cue]
    CUE --> PCM[Recorder captures bounded PCM]
    PCM --> STREAM[ASR / polish streaming]
    STREAM --> EVENTS[Emit capsule:state + backend:event]
    EVENTS --> CAPSULE[Capsule renders level / text / status]
    EVENTS --> INSERT[Insert final or streamed text]
    INSERT --> END[Done / cancelled / error]
    END --> EXIT[Capsule exit animation\nstop cue / release transient resources]
    MAIN -. opening main during recording .-> NOAUDIO[Main WebView has no AudioCueListener\nno replayed start sound]
